---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import CtaSection from '../components/CtaSection.astro';
const title = "Hainan Tours — Tropical Beaches & Rainforests";
---
<BaseLayout title={title} description="Explore Hainan Island — Sanya beaches, tropical rainforests, luxury resorts. China’s Hawaii with private tours, water sports, and relaxing beach holidays from 4 to 10 days." ogImage="/assets/images/hero-mountains.jpg">


<section class="page-hero" style="background: linear-gradient(rgba(0,0,0,0.45),rgba(0,0,0,0.45)),url('/assets/images/hero-silkroad.jpg') center/cover;">
  <div class="container"><h1>Hainan</h1><p>China’s tropical paradise — palm-fringed beaches, lush rainforests, and endless summer</p></div>
</section>
<script type="application/ld+json">
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "BreadcrumbList",
  "itemListElement": [
    { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 1, "name": "Home", "item": "https://silkroadwondertours.com/" },
    { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 2, "name": "Hainan Tours" }
  ]
}
</script>
<nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><div class="container"><a href="/">Home</a> <span class="sep">/</span> <span>Hainan Tours</span></div></nav>

<section class="section"><div class="container">
<div class="section-header reveal">
  <h2>Welcome to China’s Hawaii</h2>
  <div class="divider"></div>
  <p>Hainan Island, China’s southernmost province, is the country’s answer to Hawaii — a tropical paradise of white-sand beaches, swaying coconut palms, and warm turquoise waters. Located at the same latitude as Hawaii, Hainan enjoys year-round summer with average temperatures of 25°C. Sanya, the “Oriental Hawaii,” is lined with luxury resorts along Yalong Bay, Dadonghai, and Haitang Bay.</p>
  <p style="margin-top:12px;">Beyond the beaches, Hainan surprises with volcanic landscapes, tropical rainforests, and Li minority culture. Hike the Yanoda Rainforest, soak in Nantian Hot Springs, explore volcanic crater parks, or shop at the world’s largest duty-free mall. Best time to visit is November to April when weather is dry and pleasant, though Hainan is a year-round destination.</p>
</div></div></section>

<section class="section section-alt"><div class="container">
<div class="tours-grid">

  <div class="tour-card reveal">
    <div class="tour-card-img"><img src="/assets/images/hero-silkroad.jpg" alt="Sanya Beach Escape" loading="lazy" width="1200" height="800"></div>
    <div class="tour-card-body">
      <div class="tour-card-meta"><span class="tour-duration">5 Days</span><span class="tour-price">$750</span></div>
      <h3>Sanya Beach Escape</h3>
      <p class="tour-route">Sanya → Yalong Bay → Wuzhizhou Island → Nanshan Temple</p>
      <p class="tour-desc">Relax on Sanya’s finest beaches, snorkel Wuzhizhou Island’s crystal waters, and visit the 108-meter Guanyin statue at Nanshan Temple overlooking the South China Sea.</p>
      <a href="/contact.html" class="btn btn-gold">View Details</a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="tour-card reveal">
    <div class="tour-card-img"><img src="/assets/images/hero-silkroad.jpg" alt="Haikou-Sanya Coastal" loading="lazy" width="1200" height="800"></div>
    <div class="tour-card-body">
      <div class="tour-card-meta"><span class="tour-duration">6 Days</span><span class="tour-price">$890</span></div>
      <h3>Haikou-Sanya Coastal</h3>
      <p class="tour-route">Haikou → Bo’ao → Wanning → Sanya</p>
      <p class="tour-desc">Drive Hainan’s scenic east coast — volcanic parks, the surf town of Riyue Bay, Bo’ao Forum, and Xinglong’s rainforests before reaching Sanya’s beaches.</p>
      <a href="/contact.html" class="btn btn-gold">View Details</a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="tour-card reveal">
    <div class="tour-card-img"><img src="/assets/images/hero-silkroad.jpg" alt="Hainan Tropical Rainforest" loading="lazy" width="1200" height="800"></div>
    <div class="tour-card-body">
      <div class="tour-card-meta"><span class="tour-duration">5 Days</span><span class="tour-price">$680</span></div>
      <h3>Hainan Tropical Rainforest</h3>
      <p class="tour-route">Sanya → Yanoda → Wuzhishan → Qixianling Hot Springs</p>
      <p class="tour-desc">Trek Yanoda Rainforest, climb Hainan’s highest peak, and soak in natural jungle hot springs — a different side of Hainan.</p>
      <a href="/contact.html" class="btn btn-gold">View Details</a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="tour-card reveal">
    <div class="tour-card-img"><img src="/assets/images/hero-silkroad.jpg" alt="Sanya Luxury Resort Retreat" loading="lazy" width="1200" height="800"></div>
    <div class="tour-card-body">
      <div class="tour-card-meta"><span class="tour-duration">4 Days</span><span class="tour-price">$1,250</span></div>
      <h3>Sanya Luxury Resort Retreat</h3>
      <p class="tour-route">Sanya → Haitang Bay → Atlantis Sanya</p>
      <p class="tour-desc">Pure indulgence — Atlantis Sanya with underwater suites and water park, spa treatments, sunset yacht cruises, and the world’s largest duty-free shopping mall.</p>
      <a href="/contact.html" class="btn btn-gold">View Details</a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="tour-card reveal">
    <div class="tour-card-img"><img src="/assets/images/hero-silkroad.jpg" alt="Hainan Golf Holiday" loading="lazy" width="1200" height="800"></div>
    <div class="tour-card-body">
      <div class="tour-card-meta"><span class="tour-duration">7 Days</span><span class="tour-price">$1,980</span></div>
      <h3>Hainan Golf Holiday</h3>
      <p class="tour-route">Haikou → Bo’ao → Sanya</p>
      <p class="tour-desc">Play world-class courses designed by Tom Weiskopf and Schmidt-Curley. Combine championship golf with luxury resorts, hot springs, and beachside dining.</p>
      <a href="/contact.html" class="btn btn-gold">View Details</a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="tour-card reveal">
    <div class="tour-card-img"><img src="/assets/images/hero-silkroad.jpg" alt="Hainan Round Island" loading="lazy" width="1200" height="800"></div>
    <div class="tour-card-body">
      <div class="tour-card-meta"><span class="tour-duration">10 Days</span><span class="tour-price">$1,480</span></div>
      <h3>Hainan Round Island</h3>
      <p class="tour-route">Haikou → Wenchang → Bo’ao → Sanya → Dongfang → Danzhou</p>
      <p class="tour-desc">The full island circuit — volcanic parks, east coast beaches, Sanya’s resorts, wild west coast through Danzhou’s ancient salt fields and Dongfang’s fishing villages.</p>
      <a href="/contact.html" class="btn btn-gold">View Details</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
</div></section>

<section class="section"><div class="container">
<div class="section-header reveal"><h2>Why Choose Hainan</h2><div class="divider"></div></div>
<div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(260px,1fr));gap:24px;">
  <div style="padding:24px;background:var(--white);border-radius:8px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);">
    <h4 style="color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:8px;">China's Hawaii</h4>
    <p style="color:var(--text-light);font-size:0.95rem;">Year-round tropical climate, 1,500 km of coastline, and some of Asia's best beaches from Sanya's white sands to the volcanic shores of Haikou. The only place in China where you can surf, dive, and snorkel in warm tropical waters.</p>
  </div>
  <div style="padding:24px;background:var(--white);border-radius:8px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);">
    <h4 style="color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:8px;">Duty-Free Paradise</h4>
    <p style="color:var(--text-light);font-size:0.95rem;">Hainan's offshore duty-free policy allows visitors to shop tax-free for luxury goods without leaving China. Sanya's Haitang Bay is home to the world's largest standalone duty-free mall with over 300 international brands.</p>
  </div>
  <div style="padding:24px;background:var(--white);border-radius:8px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);">
    <h4 style="color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:8px;">Indigenous Culture</h4>
    <p style="color:var(--text-light);font-size:0.95rem;">Discover the unique traditions of the Li and Miao ethnic minorities — Li brocade weaving (a UNESCO Intangible Heritage), traditional long houses, and the mysterious tattooed Li women of Baoting, the last generation to bear this ancient custom.</p>
  </div>
</div>
<div style="margin-top:32px;padding:24px;background:var(--cream);border-radius:8px;text-align:center;">
  <p style="color:var(--navy);font-weight:600;margin-bottom:8px;">Best Time to Visit: November &ndash; April</p>
  <p style="color:var(--text-light);font-size:0.95rem;">The dry season offers sunshine, low humidity, and perfect beach weather. Avoid May-October typhoon season. Chinese New Year (January-February) is peak season — book 2-3 months ahead.</p>
</div>
</div></section>

<section class="cta-section">
<div class="container"><div class="cta-grid">
  <div class="cta-text reveal"><h2>Escape to Hainan</h2><p>Let our expert team craft your perfect itinerary — free consultation, no obligation.</p><a href="/contact.html" class="btn btn-gold">Contact Us Today</a></div>
</div></div></section>


<CtaSection />
</BaseLayout>